(materi_damage stress, manual Pro 2.2.5: sigma_damaged = (1-d) sigma_undamaged.
 1D bar, eps = 6e-4 in 60 steps, Mazars. Theory: d = 1-exp(-15000*3.4e-4) =
 0.9939032534, sigma = (1-d)*E*eps = 85598.32178. Pro 02-08-2026: 85598.32178.
